WEBVTT

00:03.634 --> 00:04.754
Hello!

00:05.104 --> 00:06.764
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:08.104 --> 00:10.944
Kotomi! My, how big you've gotten!

00:10.944 --> 00:12.744
Oh, she's finally here, eh?

00:12.744 --> 00:15.374
It's been a long time, Mr. Isogai.

00:17.884 --> 00:21.684
This kid here is Amino, my old childhood friend.

00:22.354 --> 00:24.624
I sort of dragged him along.

00:24.624 --> 00:25.884
Uh, hello.

00:25.884 --> 00:28.354
Welcome! Please come in.

00:30.494 --> 00:33.054
Miss Sato! We have guests!

00:34.564 --> 00:35.754
Coming!

00:38.464 --> 00:39.734
Will it be just the two of you?

00:39.734 --> 00:40.604
Yeah.

00:40.604 --> 00:42.574
And will you be sharing the same room?

00:43.404 --> 00:44.734
H-hold on just a-

00:58.924 --> 01:02.484
Something reached for but cannot be grasped...

01:03.794 --> 01:07.324
Something that strays from that hand,
going far away...

01:08.964 --> 01:13.294
People will always pursue such things.

01:14.334 --> 01:17.794
And before long, become lost.

01:23.744 --> 01:28.344
This is our story of one such summer.

01:46.664 --> 01:48.104
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

01:48.104 --> 01:51.774
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow
Asphalt ni saita

01:51.774 --> 01:52.244
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

01:52.544 --> 01:56.204
Kodomo no rakugaki ga

01:56.984 --> 02:00.604
Kagerou ni yurarete

02:01.454 --> 02:04.284
Arukidashita

02:04.424 --> 02:09.254
Daremo shiranai yakusoku no

02:09.254 --> 02:12.884
Oka de meguriau

02:13.434 --> 02:18.134
Tatta ichido no kyou to iu

02:18.134 --> 02:22.904
Kiseki no toki wo kanjite

02:22.904 --> 02:27.074
Nagareru kumo oikakete

02:27.074 --> 02:31.414
Imanimo tsukamesou na

02:31.414 --> 02:35.784
Mune no yokan takanari

02:35.784 --> 02:40.414
Ugokihajimeta unmei

02:40.524 --> 02:44.894
Me ga sameru hodo mabushii

02:44.894 --> 02:48.924
Asa no hi yorimo atatakai

02:49.164 --> 02:53.064
Owari no nai kagayaku

02:53.404 --> 03:00.704
Hikari no kisetsu ni dakarete

03:03.014 --> 03:07.144
The True Name

03:09.454 --> 03:11.584
Were you that surprised?

03:11.584 --> 03:14.494
Kotomi kept telling me about her "teacher",

03:14.494 --> 03:16.924
so I never imagined you'd be
running a bed and breakfast.

03:18.094 --> 03:19.924
I'm more of an ex-teacher.

03:19.924 --> 03:21.894
He got fired, ya know? Fired!

03:21.894 --> 03:23.504
K-Kotomi!

03:23.504 --> 03:25.504
How cruel, Shiozaki!

03:25.504 --> 03:27.294
Hmm? Are you saying I'm mistaken?

03:27.574 --> 03:29.904
You're the same as always, Shiozaki.

03:40.584 --> 03:42.014
What're you looking at?

03:42.254 --> 03:43.874
N-nothing!

03:45.554 --> 03:47.354
Nothing, I said!

03:47.594 --> 03:50.584
Come on, you can tell
Big Sister Kotomi anything.

03:50.864 --> 03:51.994
Big Sister?

03:51.994 --> 03:56.294
That's right! Tetsu is actually
a sixth grader in elementary school.

03:56.294 --> 03:59.924
Goodness! Elementary schoolers
certainly are big these days!

04:02.174 --> 04:05.644
Thank you. Did you find them easily enough?

04:05.644 --> 04:09.514
Yes. But I couldn't seem to find any thyme.

04:14.054 --> 04:17.154
And that's that! Think you've got it?

04:17.154 --> 04:21.254
Oh no, I still couldn't...

04:21.254 --> 04:22.994
Have you ever used an oven?

04:22.994 --> 04:24.064
No.

04:24.064 --> 04:26.164
We never had one at home.

04:26.164 --> 04:27.694
They're quite convenient, you know.

04:27.694 --> 04:29.354
They are, aren't they?

04:29.534 --> 04:31.724
You can bake cakes and whatnot with them.

04:32.804 --> 04:33.794
Um!

04:34.974 --> 04:37.274
Who are those guests that arrived just now?

04:37.274 --> 04:41.514
The girl is my husband's old student.

04:41.514 --> 04:43.774
The boy is her friend.

04:44.314 --> 04:47.544
The girl moved here close to us,
so we invited her to come by.

04:52.754 --> 04:53.954
Wow!

04:53.954 --> 04:55.654
Awesome!

04:55.654 --> 04:57.754
So this fish was?

04:59.464 --> 05:04.504
Sitting at a table facing the ocean
while eating the bounty of that ocean.

05:04.504 --> 05:06.864
There is simply no finer luxury!

05:07.104 --> 05:09.104
You can even catch fish like this?

05:09.104 --> 05:10.134
Of course.

05:10.134 --> 05:11.734
Awesome!

05:13.774 --> 05:16.344
No, I couldn't do that!

05:16.344 --> 05:19.384
I can't very well take money
from a student, can I?

05:19.384 --> 05:22.614
After all, I was the one who invited you here.

05:22.614 --> 05:24.954
Don't worry yourself about it. Right?

05:24.954 --> 05:28.394
That's right, Kotomi.
Just relax and enjoy yourself.

05:28.394 --> 05:31.514
Well then, I'll help out with things tomorrow!

05:32.094 --> 05:34.534
Also, is it all right if Tetsu stays, too?

05:34.534 --> 05:36.534
No, Kotomi! I'll be fine!

05:36.534 --> 05:37.704
Don't trouble yourself.

05:37.704 --> 05:40.604
It looks like it'll rain tomorrow,
so just take things easy.

05:40.604 --> 05:42.964
Huh?! It's gonna rain tomorrow?

05:43.274 --> 05:45.834
The beach is fine even in the rain, you know.

05:46.074 --> 05:48.074
Only YOU think that, sir.

05:48.074 --> 05:49.474
Did something happen?

05:50.414 --> 05:53.874
You were living with him, right?
Iokawa's older brother.

05:54.554 --> 05:55.644
Um...

05:56.014 --> 05:57.614
Did you break up or something?

05:58.724 --> 05:59.774
Yes...

06:00.084 --> 06:01.424
Amino?

06:01.424 --> 06:02.494
Y-yes?

06:02.494 --> 06:04.724
Do you know Miss Sato?

06:04.724 --> 06:06.354
Uh, yes.

06:06.924 --> 06:10.564
Really? You know, I think
I've seen her somewhere.

06:10.564 --> 06:13.004
There's this girl in my grade,
and this is her brother's...

06:15.474 --> 06:16.764
Friend!

06:17.374 --> 06:20.064
This is my classmate's brother's friend!

06:21.414 --> 06:24.744
Hmm? The two of you look
something like a couple to me.

06:24.744 --> 06:27.054
Sir, that's not it at all!

06:27.054 --> 06:29.044
Tetsu already has his obsession.

06:29.454 --> 06:30.584
Obsession?

06:30.584 --> 06:35.154
I mean, he's out searching for his classmate,
and he came all the way out here alone!

06:35.154 --> 06:37.314
What's more, when it comes to that girl he's...

06:37.694 --> 06:40.564
There's no need to be talking about this
right now, is there?!

06:42.934 --> 06:44.664
I told you, you've got the wrong idea!

06:44.664 --> 06:47.154
You're blushing all the way to your ears!

06:49.404 --> 06:51.034
Oh...

06:52.074 --> 06:55.274
He's still been out looking for me.

06:57.784 --> 07:00.114
Looking for this girl
Karada lokawa

07:09.924 --> 07:11.514
G'morning.

07:13.934 --> 07:15.484
Good morning!

07:16.234 --> 07:18.734
You're cleaning this early already?

07:18.734 --> 07:21.634
I have to finish up before
any of the guests arrive.

07:21.634 --> 07:23.174
Oh.

07:23.174 --> 07:25.344
Yeah, I guess that's right.

07:25.344 --> 07:27.174
By the way...

07:27.174 --> 07:28.044
Yes?

07:28.044 --> 07:29.574
Miss Sato, haven't we?

07:29.574 --> 07:30.874
Yes, sir.

07:31.444 --> 07:33.774
There are guest houses and so on
out by the beach, right?

07:34.084 --> 07:39.754
Yes. If you're looking for someone,
those may be your best bet.

07:39.754 --> 07:41.124
Thank you very much!

07:42.024 --> 07:44.684
Well, somebody's all fired up.

07:48.294 --> 07:52.824
It sure is great weather, huh?
I wonder if it will really rain.

07:53.604 --> 07:54.464
Um!

07:55.574 --> 07:59.204
I can do the cleaning on my own, so if you like...

07:59.204 --> 08:01.144
Oh, don't worry about me!

08:01.814 --> 08:03.644
Well, let's hurry up and get to it!

08:03.644 --> 08:05.134
O-okay.

08:08.614 --> 08:10.844
TODAY'S LUNCH
*SAUTÉED FISH
IN ISOKA'S ORIGINAL SAUCE
WITH BREAD OR RICE,
SALAD AND DESSERT
COFFEE OR TEA
*SEAFOOD

08:14.024 --> 08:16.954
So that's one A Set and one B Set, yes?

08:18.064 --> 08:19.424
Here's your order.

08:33.874 --> 08:36.314
Today's
Lunch
FINISHED!

08:36.874 --> 08:38.744
It's finally over!

08:39.214 --> 08:40.714
Thanks for your hard work.

08:40.714 --> 08:42.214
It was quite difficult, wasn't it?

08:42.214 --> 08:44.684
Uh, not at all! I'm just fine!

08:44.684 --> 08:49.024
We don't have any overnight reservations,
so feel free to just relax.

08:49.254 --> 08:50.764
Miss Sato!

08:50.764 --> 08:53.624
Once you've finished cleaning up,
that will be all for you, too.

08:53.624 --> 08:54.784
Yes, ma'am!

08:57.604 --> 08:58.564
Um...

08:58.564 --> 08:59.554
Yes?

09:00.434 --> 09:01.634
Where's Teacher?

09:05.304 --> 09:06.534
Teach!

09:09.214 --> 09:11.644
So you're out here skipping work again.

09:11.784 --> 09:14.544
I can't say I like the sound of "skipping work"!

09:14.954 --> 09:18.424
I'm procuring ingredients
for our guests' evening meals.

09:18.424 --> 09:21.394
I heard you won't be having any guests tonight...

09:23.124 --> 09:26.684
Is that so? Well, a side dish
for tonight's dinner, then.

09:29.634 --> 09:31.694
Was the work difficult for you?

09:32.504 --> 09:35.904
Not at all. I think it really suits me.

09:35.904 --> 09:37.904
I'm glad to hear it.

09:37.904 --> 09:40.474
The scenery's great, the ocean's beautiful...

09:40.474 --> 09:42.634
It makes me want to stay forever.

09:43.444 --> 09:45.604
Have you already been out to the seashore?

09:47.014 --> 09:49.814
There's a legend about that shore, you know.

09:49.814 --> 09:50.414
MEGUMI
+
KAZUHIRO

09:50.414 --> 09:52.324
MEGUMI
+
KAZUHIRO
At the end of summer,

09:52.324 --> 09:54.354
MEGUMI
+
KAZUHIRO
if you write the name of someone close to
your heart and return it to the ocean,

09:54.354 --> 09:55.954
if you write the name of someone close to
your heart and return it to the ocean,

09:55.954 --> 09:58.424
you will definitely meet that person again.

10:00.264 --> 10:02.854
You really are a strange one.

10:04.064 --> 10:07.004
All you ever talk about are girly stories like that.

10:07.004 --> 10:10.064
Everyone's stopped believing
what you say, you know.

10:10.974 --> 10:13.904
But you believed me.

10:15.214 --> 10:17.484
I heard from your father.

10:17.484 --> 10:20.954
He said that my stories were interesting...

10:20.954 --> 10:23.944
And that you seemed to enjoy
telling them to him.

10:25.184 --> 10:27.154
Did he really say that?

10:27.824 --> 10:29.984
Is your father doing well?

10:30.394 --> 10:31.754
Probably.

10:32.064 --> 10:33.724
I'm glad to hear it.

10:48.674 --> 10:51.404
If you like, how about we go see
a movie tomorrow?

10:53.644 --> 10:56.774
Sometimes I even get mistaken
for a college student.

10:57.054 --> 10:59.954
So it'll be like being accompanied
by a guardian! Right?

11:27.084 --> 11:29.654
You have a lot of secrets, don't you?

11:29.654 --> 11:31.444
I do, don't I?

11:31.554 --> 11:33.284
What's with the two of you?

11:34.024 --> 11:38.324
Miss Shoko and I made a wish.
On the wishing stones.

11:38.464 --> 11:40.024
Wishing stones?

11:40.024 --> 11:41.964
The heck did you wish for?

11:45.734 --> 11:47.364
It's a secret...

11:48.034 --> 11:49.624
What's a secret?

12:11.124 --> 12:12.954
So what's this secret?

12:14.664 --> 12:16.224
It's a secret.

12:20.804 --> 12:22.234
That routine again, huh?

12:23.834 --> 12:26.534
Anyway, what brings you out here, Amino?

12:28.344 --> 12:30.934
I've been here before, with lokawa.

12:32.914 --> 12:34.544
I see.

12:51.134 --> 12:53.064
I don't need a "guardian," all right?

12:53.964 --> 12:56.304
My way back is the same as yours, that's all.

12:59.174 --> 13:01.834
Have you been searching for her
this whole time?

13:02.844 --> 13:03.744
Yeah.

13:05.344 --> 13:09.074
Aren't the people you've left back home
worried about you?

13:09.614 --> 13:12.514
I told them I'm staying with a friend,
so they're fine.

13:14.194 --> 13:16.784
Why are you trying so hard?

13:20.164 --> 13:21.594
Because it's her.

13:24.564 --> 13:27.054
She's not scared of me.

13:27.934 --> 13:30.304
She was the one who gave me my nickname...

13:31.074 --> 13:33.204
And she's more responsible than me.

13:34.774 --> 13:35.514
But!

13:35.514 --> 13:39.914
She's THIS frickin' small! Like THIS!
She's always been that way.

13:45.324 --> 13:47.414
So I...

13:49.394 --> 13:51.054
If you don't find her...

13:52.694 --> 13:54.954
If it turns out you don't find her?

13:57.234 --> 13:58.164
I will find her.

13:58.164 --> 13:58.264
But!
I will find her.

13:58.264 --> 13:59.064
But!

13:59.064 --> 14:00.564
I'll search until I find her!

14:00.564 --> 14:00.734
But!
I'll search until I find her!

14:00.734 --> 14:01.324
But!

14:06.304 --> 14:08.504
I'll find her because I love her!

14:13.584 --> 14:16.714
Aargh! That's what this is all about!

14:19.184 --> 14:20.744
Also...

14:22.354 --> 14:24.294
This might be my fault.

14:38.444 --> 14:42.134
S-sorry! What am I talking about?!
I'm really sorry!

14:51.384 --> 14:53.014
Amino...

14:54.084 --> 14:58.524
I... I'm here.

15:18.444 --> 15:19.704
You're leaving?

15:21.114 --> 15:22.104
Yes.

15:23.314 --> 15:26.914
Because it was Karada that had been
keeping us together...

15:29.454 --> 15:31.224
Even if she herself doesn't think so.

15:31.864 --> 15:34.954
She thinks she's what drove us apart.

15:36.394 --> 15:40.354
That's why I can't stay here.

15:45.774 --> 15:51.284
Our List

15:51.284 --> 15:53.014
Our List
What will you do?

15:54.514 --> 15:56.174
Just wait?

15:58.184 --> 16:03.124
Our List of
Promises

16:18.204 --> 16:21.874
Our List of
Promises
- No fighting
- Always be polite
- No secrets
- Eat meals together

16:36.254 --> 16:38.464
The rain's gotten stronger
than expected, hasn't it?

16:38.464 --> 16:41.294
Yes. I wonder if Amino is all right.

16:41.294 --> 16:44.164
I'm sure he's gotten out of the rain somewhere.

16:44.164 --> 16:45.894
I certainly hope so.

16:49.174 --> 16:52.104
I wonder if... he's all right.

16:52.904 --> 16:55.344
I'm going to look for him!

17:16.764 --> 17:18.424
Ow...

17:24.374 --> 17:25.734
Dammit!

17:38.084 --> 17:39.524
Amino?

17:44.254 --> 17:45.624
Amino!

17:46.294 --> 17:48.034
Are you all right, Amino?

17:48.034 --> 17:49.394
Amino!

18:14.524 --> 18:17.824
He's fine. The injury is nothing serious.

18:17.824 --> 18:19.464
What about his fever?

18:19.464 --> 18:22.394
It was 38 degrees Celsius when
I measured it earlier.

18:22.764 --> 18:24.434
Will he be all right?

18:24.434 --> 18:30.004
If his fever hasn't come down by morning,
I'll take him to the hospital.

18:30.004 --> 18:33.404
He got wet and chilled, but it's
nothing to be concerned about.

18:33.844 --> 18:35.464
You should get some rest.

18:37.574 --> 18:38.874
Um...

18:39.414 --> 18:41.044
I want to watch over him.

18:42.654 --> 18:43.614
Oh.

18:55.834 --> 18:58.504
How's Amino doing?

18:58.504 --> 19:00.234
His injury is nothing serious.

19:00.234 --> 19:02.034
That's good news.

19:02.034 --> 19:04.734
I think his fever will probably break by tomorrow.

19:05.204 --> 19:06.874
I'm so glad!

19:06.874 --> 19:09.344
He's always running off half-cocked!

19:09.344 --> 19:11.844
Is he asleep right now?

19:11.844 --> 19:14.904
Yes. Miss Sato said she'd keep him company.

19:42.714 --> 19:44.174
I'm sorry.

19:44.944 --> 19:51.074
Amino... It's because of me that this happened...

20:09.904 --> 20:11.464
Are you all right?

20:12.874 --> 20:16.004
You've been here... the whole time?

20:17.114 --> 20:20.444
How are you feeling? Are you in pain?

20:21.854 --> 20:23.544
I'm fine.

20:30.224 --> 20:32.854
I wonder if she's gotten out
of the rain somewhere.

20:33.894 --> 20:35.864
I have to hurry up and find her.

20:37.634 --> 20:40.154
You can't until your fever's come down.

20:46.344 --> 20:48.774
It's not your fault at all.

20:49.544 --> 20:52.744
She wouldn't have left because
you'd made her cry.

20:55.414 --> 20:57.444
I can't leave her alone.

20:58.354 --> 20:59.544
Not her.

21:02.794 --> 21:04.384
Amino...

21:05.394 --> 21:10.094
Amino, I'm sure that you'll find her.

21:13.664 --> 21:17.964
Thank you... Miss Sato.

21:23.044 --> 21:25.344
I'll find her because I love her!

21:27.614 --> 21:29.244
Amino...

21:44.194 --> 21:45.354
My...

21:47.934 --> 21:49.424
My name is...

22:14.894 --> 22:21.134
Narenai kutsu wo haita

22:21.134 --> 22:25.864
Ippozutsu taeru itami

22:27.304 --> 22:33.584
Soredemo aruku no wa

22:33.584 --> 22:38.384
Kaeru basho ga aru kara

22:39.154 --> 22:47.294
Watashi ga watashi wo mitsumete

22:47.294 --> 22:51.894
Kizuita wasuremono

22:55.034 --> 23:01.204
Anato to issho ni itai

23:01.204 --> 23:07.914
Chikaku de, tooku de kanjitai yo

23:07.914 --> 23:13.784
Atarimae no mainichi

23:13.784 --> 23:20.424
Itoshii anato to tsukuritsuzukeru

23:20.424 --> 23:27.854
"Tadaima" to kutsu wo nuide, dakishimeru

23:28.104 --> 23:32.934
My sweet home

23:45.324 --> 23:47.984
Scattered fragments may once again...

23:48.554 --> 23:50.684
If that girl cries...

23:50.854 --> 23:52.954
If a hand is outstretched...

23:53.994 --> 23:56.764
Dreams not yet begun and those already ended

23:56.764 --> 24:02.634
want the people we've become
to take hold of that small hand.

24:02.934 --> 24:06.204
Toward a new light, one as yet unseen...

24:07.274 --> 24:09.044
Next time, on Living for the Day After Tomorrow:

24:09.044 --> 24:09.944
Next episode
The Present That Exists There
Next time, on Living for the Day After Tomorrow:

24:09.944 --> 24:11.914
Next episode
The Present That Exists There
"The Present That Exists There"

24:11.914 --> 24:13.144
Next episode
The Present That Exists There
